1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
At 3:00 PM, Northvale Dairy Co-op recalls a lot of infant formula.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:10,000
At 3:04, the agent tells the distribution centre it's fine to ship 4,800 tins.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
The agent isn't broken. It's remembering a certificate that no longer exists.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,000
This is the agent's memory of that lot.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,500
Three things it observed. Three conclusions it built on top of them.

6
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:26,500
Every memory store on the market can write these. Not one of them can take one back.

7
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:30,000
Retraction needs transactions, foreign keys, and time travel.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
No vector database has any of the three. CockroachDB has all three.

9
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Right now, the agent says: release.

10
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,500
One certificate withdrawn.

11
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:48,000
Two conclusions built on it came down with it.

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,000
One decision already given to a human, flagged for review.

13
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
One transaction. All of it, or none of it.

14
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,500
Same lot. Same question. Asked again.

15
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:02,000
The agent refuses.

16
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Not because a model changed its mind.

17
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:10,500
Because it can now find only one live supporting memory, and the threshold is two.

18
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:15,500
Retraction didn't hide a row. It changed what the agent is able to conclude.

19
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:19,000
And it can still prove what it used to know.

20
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,500
This is not a reconstruction.

21
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,000
The decision stored the cluster's hybrid logical clock,

22
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,500
so this reads the exact snapshot the agent read at 3:04.

23
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:41,000
One detail, because it is why this works at all.

24
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:47,000
The retracted flag is a computed column, and a prefix column of the vector index.

25
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:52,500
CockroachDB will not use a vector index unless every prefix column is constrained.

26
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:56,500
So every single search is forced to say: retracted = false.

27
00:01:56,500 --> 00:02:00,500
Retracted memory isn't filtered out. It is unreachable.

28
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:05,000
Every test runs against a real CockroachDB cluster, on every push.

29
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:09,500
No database mocks. The behaviour only exists in CockroachDB.

30
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:16,500
The buyer is a director of quality assurance at a food or pharma distributor.

31
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:21,500
The budget line is FSMA 204. Compliance date: July 20th, 2028.

32
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:25,000
They cannot deploy an agent into a recall workflow today,

33
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:30,000
because they cannot prove what it knew, and cannot take back what it learned.

34
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:35,500
When a lot is recalled, Rescind pulls back every conclusion the agent built on it -

35
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:41,000
in one transaction, with proof of what the agent knew before and after.
